notes.content:
[h3]We made the following changes:[/h3]  
[list]  
[*] Reworked the R-abilities of Red Riding Hood and Alice;  
[*] Adjusted the bean reward system: all players now receive beans after killing enemies, opening chests, and completing waves;  
[*] Added a sound effect for energy gain on "Grim Tales" difficulty;  
[*] The first artifact in the shop now has a permanent 25% discount;  
[*] Changed the lobby background;  
[*] Improved the purchasing process for Story Shards;  
[*] Fixed network desynchronization when triggering the boss cutscene;  
[*] Added additional colliders to the game level.  
[/list]
